{"id":"wb-7-992","name":"国安寺塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"国安寺塔","text":"国安寺塔位于浙江省温州市龙湾区瑶溪镇皇岙。建于北宋元祐五年至八年（1090－1093年）间。塔为楼阁式实心石塔，高九层，平面六边形，现残高约17米。1989年12月12日列入浙江省文物保护单位，2013年5月列入第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%89%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94","revisionId":86834607,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86834607","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/91fb2dc9c4d79d988459708d.jpg","title":"Pagoda_of_Guoan_Temple,_2021-05-01_05.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pagoda_of_Guoan_Temple,_2021-05-01_05.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4f/Pagoda_of_Guoan_Temple%2C_2021-05-01_05.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​温州龙湾国安寺塔","width":320,"height":214}}